 stereo-canvas-no-limits = This page's 3D scene stays flat: the desktop does not tell the browser your depth limits (Stereo KWin is missing).
 stereo-display-settings-failed = KDE's Display Configuration could not be opened: systemsettings was not found or did not start.
+# Shown once per session in the window's notification bar when the browser draws its window without the graphics card.
+# $reason (string) - the compositor's name and the graphics layer's own failure id and message, in English.
+stereo-software-compositor = 3D is off in this session: the browser is drawing without the graphics card, so it cannot hand a page's two views to the desktop. Pages show their ordinary picture. Reason: { $reason }
 
 stereo-xr-exit = Exit 3D
 stereo-xr-hint-flat = Esc leaves 3D. Drag with the mouse to look; W, A, S, D or the arrow keys and the wheel move you.
